    },
    {
      "text": "Mix ground beef, eggs, bread crumbs, and ketchup in a large bowl until well combined. Season with Italian-style seasoning, oregano, basil, garlic salt, diced tomatoes, and cheese. Press into a 9x5-inch loaf pan, and cover loosely with foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
