        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LEXPAqygGR1U7OPJc2d56Ltrexw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14592-Beef-Italian-Meatloaf-step-2-032-2b4ab918ecd9429a9a4e8d854a0f8c22.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14592/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until internal temperature reaches 160 degrees F (70 degrees C), about 1 hour.",
